{"strings":["LPCO","Details related to Licenses, Permits, Certificates or Others.","Document effective date/time","Date and time of effectiveness of the document (e.g. license, visa, permit, certificate).","Document expiration date/time","Date and time of expiration of the document (e.g. license, visa, permit, certificate).","Message function code","Code specifying the function of a document.","DocumentFunctionCodeList","Document function","Purpose of the document.","Document identifier","Identification of a specific document.","Document reference number, assigned by the Government","Document issuing date/time","Date and time the document was issued and when appropriate, signed or otherwise authenticated.","Document issuing location identifier","Identification of the location at which a document was issued and when appropriate, signed or otherwise authenticated.","UN/LOCODE","Document issuing location name","Name of the location at which a document was issued and when needed, signed or otherwise authenticated.","Document name","Name of the document.","Transitional element","Document original indicator","Indicator to differentiate whether an exchanged CITES e-permitting document is a legal original or not.","Only to be used as a transitional measure!","Document name code","Code specifying the name of a document.","UN/EDIFACT code list 1001 OR User code list","Authentication","Details related to the authentication of a document.","Authentication type code","Code specifying the type of authentication.","User code list","Authentication identifier","Identification of the authentication.","Actual authentication date/time","Date and time when this authentication was actually signed or otherwise authenticated.","Actual authentication location identifier","Identification of the location where a document was signed or otherwise authenticated.","Authentication statement","Statement providing proof that the document has been authenicated.","Document authentication location name","Name of a location where a document was signed or otherwise authenticated.","Authenticator","Details related to an authenticating party.","Authenticator name","Name of the party which certifies that a document is authentic.","Authenticator identifier","Identification of a party which certifies that a document is authentic.","International codes (e.g. DUNS, EAN) OR User codes","Role code","Code specifying the role of a party.","UN/EDIFACT code list 3035","Address","Details related to an address.","Address type code","Code specifying the type of address.","AddressTypeCodeList","City name","Name of a city.","Country code","Code specifying the name of the country or other geographical entity as specified in ISO 3166 and UN/ECE Rec 3.","CountryCodeList","Country name","Name of the country or other geographical entity.","Country sub-entity identification code","Code specifying the name of a country subdivision.","ISO 3166-2 OR User code list","Country sub-entity name","Name of a country subdivision.","Street and number/P.O. Box","Specification of the postal delivery point such as street and number or post office box.","Not to be used in combination with Street name, House number, House number addition and P.O. Box","Postcode identifier","Identification of the postal zone or address.","AuthorizedPerson","Details related to a person designated under relevant legislation for the purpose of issuing official assurances.","Authorised person name","Name of a person designated under relevant legislation for the purpose of issuing official assurances.","Authorized person identifier","Identification of a person designated under relevant legislation for the purpose of issuing official assurances.","AdditionalDocument","Details related to additional documents as part of a declaration or as part of a response.","Additional document identifier","Identification of a document providing additional information.","Additional document issuing date/time","Date and time of issuing an additional document and when needed, signed or otherwise authenticated.","Additional document name","Name of the additional document.","Additional document type code","Code specifying the type of an additional document.","AdditionalInformation","Details related to the special request from declarant to government to take or not to take action.","In case of using Additional statement code, text or indicator you can make the information more specific by also using Additional statement type.\nIf there are more than 1 occurrences you should always use it in combination with the type.","Additional statement type code","Code specifying the subject of the additional statement.","StatementTypeCodeList","Consignment","Details related to the transport between a consignor and a consignee as specified in the transport contract document.","Sequence number","Number indicating the position in a sequence.","Consignee","Details related to the party to which goods are consigned.","Consignee name","Name of the party to which goods are consigned.","Consignee identifier","Identification of a party to which goods are consigned.","ConsignmentItem","Details related to an item in a consignment.","Consignment item identifier","Identification of the consignment item (e.g. for CITES codes A, B, C, D).","Commodity","Details related to the properties of the goods.","Goods description","Description of the nature of a goods item sufficient to identify it for cross-border regulatory purposes such as customs, phytosanitary, statistical or transport.","Commodity category code","Code specifying the grouping of similar products into non-commercial categories that are assigned by and useful to regulatory authorities.  More specific than the Goods group name (WCO ID 331) and Goods group name, coded (WCO ID 332).","CommodityCategoryCodeList","Manufacture date/time","Date and time that the commodity was manufactured, produced, or grown.","Commodity acquisition date/time","Date and time the commodity was acquired.","Classification","Details related to the non-commercial categorization of a commodity by a standard-setting organization.","Commodity classification identifier","Identification of the non-commercial categorization of a commodity by a standard-setting organization.","Commodity classification name code","Code specifying the scientific name of original plant/animal used as a material for food products, medications, cosmetics, medical materials, etc.","ClassificationNameCodeList","Commodity classification type code","Code specifying the commodity classification  (e.g. Harmonized Tariff Schedule (HTS), Export Control Classification Code (ECCC), UNDG Code list, International Code of Zoological Nomenc).","UN/EDIFACT code list 7143","Product","Details related to the tangible article or substance produced by human or mechanical effort or by a natural process.","Product identifier","Identification of an object, for example the unique number affixed by the manufacturer to a product for identification purposes.","Commodity identifier type code","Code specifying the type of commodity identifier.","ProductName","Details related to the name of a product.","Commodity name","Name or term that identifies the goods assigned by a seller as distinct from those of other sellers, in legal terms known as trademark, which helps to identify one item, a family of items, or all items of that seller.","Commodity name qualifier code","Code specifying the commodity name (e.g. common name, registered name, brand name).","UN/EDIFACT code list 7081","Source","Details related to the source of goods in accordance with regulation and laws.","Source country code","Code specifying the source country.","Control","Details related to (governmental) examination.","ControlResult","Details related to the outcome of (governmental) examination.","Control quantity","Quantity specifying the control results of an inspection, carried out by cross border regulatory agencies.","ExportCountry","Details related to the export country.","Country of exportation code","Code specifying  the country from which the goods are originally exported without any commercial transaction taken place in intermediate countries.","Country of exportation name","Name of the country from which the goods are originally exported without any commercial transaction taken place in intermediate countries.","GoodsMeasure","Details related to goods weight, quantities, and amounts.","Annual quota quantity","Quantity specifying the current annual quota for the species concerned.","Exported to date in current year quantity","Quantity specifying the total number of specimens exported in the current calendar year (1 January to 31 December) (including those covered by the present permit).","Origin","Details related to the origin of the goods.","Country of origin code","Code specifying the country in which the goods have been produced or manufactured, according to criteria laid down for the application of the Customs tariff or quantitative restrictions, or any measure related to trade.","Country of origin name","Name of the country in which the goods have been produced or manufactured, according to criteria laid down for the application of the Customs tariff or quantitative restrictions, or any measure related to trade.","Packaging","Details related to packaging.","Number of packages","Quantity specifying the number of individual items packaged in such a way that they cannot be divided without first undoing the packing.","Consignor","Details related to the party which, by contract with a carrier, consigns or sends goods with the carrier, or has them conveyed by him.","Consignor name","Name of the party consigning goods as stipulated in the transport contract by the party ordering transport.","Consignor identifier","Identification of  the party consigning goods as stipulated in the transport contract by the party ordering the transport.","Declaration review location identifier","Identification of the location where the declaration is reviewed by appropriate government agency. This may be different from place where declaration is lodged, paid, or acquitted.","UN/LOCODE + User codes OR User code list","Declaration review location name","Name of the location where the declaration is reviewed by appropriate government agency. This may be different from place where declaration is lodged, paid, or acquitted.","Event start date/time","Date and time at which a specified event becomes effective.","Event end date/time","Date and time at which a specified event is completed.","Certifier","Details related to the party which certifies something.","Certifier name","Name of the party who has provided the certification.","TransportContractDocument","Details related to the consignment which corresponds to one transport contract. (Known as consignment by the Transport group).","Transport document identifier","Identification of the document evidencing a transport contract by reference number.","Transport document type code","Code specifying the type of a document evidencing a transport contract ."],"root":{"s":"LPCO","n":0,"d":1,"t":"C","c":"","w":"74B","u":"0001L","q":"1","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/LPCO","src":"BIP LPCO:4","k":[{"s":"effective","n":2,"d":3,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"EffectiveDateTime","f":"an..35","w":"D052","u":"0001L","q":"3","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/effectiveDateTime","ub":["cites"],"src":"BIP LPCO:6"},{"s":"expiration","n":4,"d":5,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"ExpirationDateTime","f":"an..35","w":"D051","u":"0001L","q":"4","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/expirationDateTime","ub":["cites","eata","ecoc","etir-carv"],"src":"BIP LPCO:7"},{"s":"function","n":6,"d":7,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"FunctionCode","f":"n..2","w":"D046","u":"0001L","q":"5","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/documentFunctionCode","l":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/code-list/document-function-code-list","ln":8,"ub":["cites","etir-guar"],"src":"BIP LPCO:8"},{"s":"functionName","n":9,"d":10,"t":"E",